    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/7/1/71780.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 29,
    "turn_text": "I think the Trump presidency is more of a populist movement than a constitutional conservative movement. I think there's no debate about that. The Tea Party movement was really about fiscal responsibility and then also about the patient protection for Obamacare, Obamacare.",
