        "confidence": 0.93
      },
      {
        "text": "The Trump presidency is primarily a populist movement.",
        "confidence": 0.92
      },
      {
        "text": "The Trump presidency is not primarily a constitutional conservative movement.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "There is no debate regarding the characterization of the Trump presidency as a populist movement.",
