        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "Fiscal responsibility and opposition to healthcare reform are central defining features of the Tea Party movement.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "Public consensus or shared understanding validates the speaker's claim about the nature of the Trump presidency.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "The distinction between populism and constitutional conservatism is meaningful and analytically useful.",
