      }
    ],
    "turn_type_label": "Substantive",
    "conversation_move_label": "Assert / Elaborate"
  },
  {
    "episode_id": 71780,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/7/1/71780.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 33,
    "turn_text": "That's absolutely right. And I think that that's one of the things that we need to push harder on when the fact that we are now about to go into trillion dollar deficit. So I think that we need to And that's one of the reasons why I want to work as the Chairman for the Republican Party here is to get strong constitutional conservatives, people that understand fiscal responsibility. Here in Texas, we have to balance our budget. And the federal government needs to be able to balance their budget. 49 out of 50 states have to do that. And so we, if we don't want to continue down this path of potential fiscal ruin, we've got to get people up in Washington, D.C. We have to keep people in our localities are municipalities and also in our state houses and places of governance uh... that understand that's the most important thing for them to do it because stores of american taxpayer dollar",
    "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00",
    "inferred_speaker_name": null,
    "inferred_speaker_role": null,
    "chosen_text_key": "transcript",
    "explicit_propositions": [
