    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/7/1/71780.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 36,
    "turn_text": "Yeah, and you're right about the way this 2020 campaign is shaping up. It's going to be a campaign of working hard and earn everything that you want versus here. We'll just give this to you for free for it for nothing. And that has a certain amount of appeal to a lot of people, especially voters under the age of 30, 35 or or the impoverished electorate.",
