        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "The typical cost associated with such promises is individual rights.",
        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "When promises are made, they typically come with a cost.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "Hugo Chavez transformed Venezuela from one of the most prosperous countries in the hemisphere into its current state.",
        "confidence": 0.88
      }
    ],
    "assumptions": [
