        "confidence": 0.94
      },
      {
        "text": "There is a direct causal link between leftist rhetoric and loss of personal freedoms.",
        "confidence": 0.93
      },
      {
        "text": "Political promises that sound appealing often conceal authoritarian consequences.",
        "confidence": 0.92
      },
      {
        "text": "Historical examples like Venezuela serve as valid warnings against progressive economic policies.",
